                        "steam_purchase": true,
                        "received_for_free": false,
                        "written_during_early_access": false,
                        "developer_response": "Hello. During loading, you should avoid clicking the mouse or pressing buttons before the game starts, and if in the open world it still crashes, try to deactivate the pro mode in the settings of the pause menu so that the game will load faster but there will be 3 pieces of maps that will not appear and when the pro mode is deactivated, to go to the other places in the open world, you must enter the other portals in the city. The position of other portals is visible through dark vision.",
